  "subject": "情报科学院_媒体网络",
  "text": "设3变元向量函数 $\\mathbf{u}(x,y,z) = 4x^2(x^2-1)\\mathbf{i} + 2y(y^2-1)\\mathbf{j} + (z+1)\\mathbf{k}$，其中 $\\mathbf{i}, \\mathbf{j}, \\mathbf{k}$ 是 $x, y, z$ 方向的单位向量。请回答下列问题：\n(1) 在 $z=1$ 的xy平面上求曲面积分 $S = \\int_{-1}^{1}\\int_{-1}^{1} \\mathbf{u} \\cdot \\mathbf{i} \\, dx dy$\n(2) 求向量函数u的散度 $f(x,y,z) = \\nabla \\cdot \\mathbf{u}$\n(3) 求体积积分 $V = \\int_{-1}^{1}\\int_{-1}^{1}\\int_{-1}^{1} f(x,y,z) \\, dx dy dz$",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "向量场的散度",
    "曲面积分",
    "体积积分",
    "多重积分",
    "矢量微积分"
  ],
  "question_type": "多部分计算题",
  "method": [
    "直接积分法",
    "散度计算",
    "分次积分"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "将曲面积分化为二重积分，提取向量场的x分量",
    "对积分变量依次积分求解曲面积分",
    "计算向量场的偏导数之和得到散度",
    "将散度作为被积函数进行三重积分"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "vector_field_integration",
    "template": "给定向量函数 $\\mathbf{u}(x,y,z) = u_x(x,y,z)\\mathbf{i} + u_y(x,y,z)\\mathbf{j} + u_z(x,y,z)\\mathbf{k}$，计算曲面与体积积分，以及散度",
    "variable_count": 3
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(1) 曲面积分S",
      "steps": [
        "曲面积分中 $\\mathbf{u} \\cdot \\mathbf{i} = 4x^2(x^2-1)$",
        "$$S = \\int_{y=-1}^{1}\\int_{x=-1}^{1} 4x^2(x^2-1) dx\\, dy = \\int_{y=-1}^{1}\\int_{x=-1}^{1} (4x^4-4x^2) dx\\, dy$$",
        "计算内层积分：$\\int_{-1}^{1} (4x^4-4x^2) dx = \\left[\\frac{4x^5}{5}-\\frac{4x^3}{3}\\right]_{-1}^{1} = \\left(\\frac{4}{5}-\\frac{4}{3}\\right) - \\left(-\\frac{4}{5}+\\frac{4}{3}\\right) = \\frac{8}{5}-\\frac{8}{3} = \\frac{24-40}{15} = -\\frac{16}{15}$",
        "计算外层积分：$S = \\int_{-1}^{1} \\left(-\\frac{16}{15}\\right) dy = -\\frac{16}{15} \\cdot 2 = -\\frac{32}{15}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2) 散度f(x,y,z)",
      "steps": [
        "$$\\nabla \\cdot \\mathbf{u} = \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}[4x^2(x^2-1)] + \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}[2y(y^2-1)] + \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z}[z+1]$$",
        "$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}[4x^4-4x^2] = 16x^3-8x$$",
        "$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}[2y^3-2y] = 6y^2-2$$",
        "$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z}[z+1] = 1$$",
        "因此 $f(x,y,z) = 16x^3 - 8x + 6y^2 - 2 + 1 = 16x^3 - 8x + 6y^2 - 1$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(3) 体积积分V",
      "steps": [
        "$$V = \\int_{z=-1}^{1}\\int_{y=-1}^{1}\\int_{x=-1}^{1} (16x^3-8x+6y^2-1) dx\\, dy\\, dz$$",
        "计算内层关于x的积分：$\\int_{-1}^{1} (16x^3-8x+6y^2-1) dx = \\left[4x^4-4x^2+(6y^2-1)x\\right]_{-1}^{1}$",
        "$$= [4-4+(6y^2-1)] - [4-4-(6y^2-1)] = (6y^2-1) - (1-6y^2) = 12y^2-2$$",
        "计算中层关于y的积分：$\\int_{-1}^{1} (12y^2-2) dy = \\left[4y^3-2y\\right]_{-1}^{1} = (4-2)-(-4+2) = 2+2 = 4$",
        "计算外层关于z的积分：$V = \\int_{-1}^{1} 4\\, dz = 4 \\cdot 2 = 8$"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
